Vendored code
-------------

This product includes software developed by the Mihon Open Source Project
(https://github.com/mihonapp/mihon), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

    Copyright 2015 Javier Tomás
    Copyright 2024 Mihon Open Source Project

Throughout this repository, "upstream" means that project. Every file taken from it carries the
first line

    // Vendored from upstream v<version>: <path> (modified: yes|no) [what changed]

where <path> is the file's path in the upstream repository at that version. A file marked
"modified: yes" was changed by the Saikou authors, and the rest of its first line says how.
Upstream packages named after the project itself were renamed to the tachiyomi prefix; the paths
in those files' first lines are written with the renamed package. Files whose first line starts
with "// Fresh:" are Saikou's own code placed in a vendored package.

Some vendored files carry their own notices, which are kept as found:

  - presentation-core/.../material/Scaffold.kt: Copyright 2021 The Android Open Source Project,
    Apache License, Version 2.0.
  - presentation-core/.../colorscheme/CatppuccinColorScheme.kt: Copyright (c) 2021 Catppuccin,
    MIT License.
  - extensions/.../RxCoroutineBridge.kt: from TachiyomiEH/SY, Apache License, Version 2.0.


Libraries
---------

The image utilities (format sniffing, page splitting and rotation, background detection,
hardware bitmap limits) are published separately as saikou-image
(https://github.com/ShinSaikou/saikou-image), under the Apache License, Version 2.0, with its own
NOTICE. Other dependencies are resolved by Gradle and keep their own licenses; their coordinates
are listed in gradle/libs.versions.toml.
